      "writtenOn": "2025-06-26T15:32:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. These commands need to return different error codes which need special handling.\n2. In Ti50 we added a new Strongbox extension command 0x20000001, so making Cr50 aligned and using same command format.\n3. The overhead is not that high actually, I checked that it is overall +62 bytes, and adding handling for subset of codes won\u0027t be much less.",
